# The .ttf font fixture is BINARY -- mark it `binary` (= -text -diff) so it checks out byte-verbatim on
# the WINDOWS build box. The repo-root `* text=auto eol=lf` catch-all could otherwise EOL/CRLF-mangle a
# misdetected font and CORRUPT it -> hb_shape garbage. Scoped to this fixtures dir.
*.ttf binary
